WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
[Soft instrumental music]
Within reach.
The articulated holder, beside the table.

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Secure the clamp.
Turn the knob. Close the padded jaws.

3
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Set the angle.
Release the cam. Adjust. Lock.

4
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:23.000
Lift. Access. Replace.
Lift the lid to reach the balm.

5
00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Release the holder.
Loosen the clamp. Lower clear. Lift away.

6
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Change position.
Move along the outside of the table.

7
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Secure near the foot.
Reattach on the long side of the table.

8
00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:46.000
Put the balm where the work is.
Harmonic Touch · The articulated holder.
